```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>AOC Flight Dashboard</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fa;
    }

    .header {
      height: 55px;
      background: #1f4e78;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 20px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .visit-btn {
      background: white;
      color: #1f4e78;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .visit-btn:hover {
      background: #e8f1f8;
    }

    .content {
      width: 100%;
      height: calc(100vh - 55px);
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: none;
      display: block;
      background: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="header">
    <div>AOC Flight Dashboard</div>

    <a
      class="visit-btn"
      href="https://sites.google.com/view/aocinfo/flight-tracking"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Visit Site ↗
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <iframe
      src="https://sites.google.com/view/aocinfo/flight-tracking"
      title="AOC Flight Dashboard"
      allowfullscreen>
    </iframe>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
```
